1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:03,837
“Just adjust it a little, Kunal…
we'll see after Diwali.”

2
00:00:04,087 --> 00:00:06,177
Your manager wants
the numbers adjusted…

3
00:00:06,177 --> 00:00:08,244
and everyone on the
call is on mute.

4
00:00:08,274 --> 00:00:10,516
Sign it… or say the truth?

5
00:00:10,706 --> 00:00:15,169
In the dice hall, Vidura warned…
this game will destroy the Kurus.

6
00:00:15,209 --> 00:00:17,838
Here, Kunal's cursor…
is on Approve.

7
00:00:17,838 --> 00:00:21,262
Duryodhana didn't listen… the king
didn't stop the game.

8
00:00:21,262 --> 00:00:24,403
“Pleasing talkers are
easy to find, O king…

9
00:00:24,403 --> 00:00:28,270
one who speaks or hears the hard
truth is rare.”

10
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:32,330
Yes-men are everywhere… the ones
who tell the truth, and hear it,

11
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:33,292
are rare.

12
00:00:33,292 --> 00:00:37,174
Kunal unmuted. “Sir, I can't sign
this. With the real numbers,

13
00:00:37,174 --> 00:00:38,544
here's a plan.”

14
00:00:38,614 --> 00:00:42,385
What would you do? Sign
it, or say the truth?
